ArchCosta User Guide
=====================

Welcome to ArchCosta, a minimal Arch Linux distribution with
the MangoWM Wayland compositor.

Keybindings
-----------
Super+Return      Open terminal (foot)
Super+Space       Application launcher (rofi)
Super+w           Open Firefox
Super+q           Close window
Super+f           Toggle fullscreen
Super+s           Toggle floating
Super+r           Reload MangoWM config
Super+m           Quit MangoWM
Super+l           Lock screen
Super+p           Screenshot (full)
Super+Shift+s     Screenshot (region)
Super+Shift+e     Power menu
Super+Shift+p     Pacman menu
Super+Shift+a     AUR menu
Super+h           Open this guide

Tags (Workspaces)
-----------------
Super+1-9         Switch to tag 1-9
Super+Shift+1-9   Move window to tag 1-9
Super+Left/Right  Switch between tags
Ctrl+Left/Right   Switch between tags (with clients only)

Window Management
-----------------
Super+Tab         Cycle focus
Super+Ctrl+Arrows Change focus direction
Super+Shift+Arrows Swap windows
Ctrl+Shift+Arrows Move floating window
Ctrl+Super+Arrows Resize floating window
Super+g           Toggle gaps
Super+i           Minimize window
Super+o           Toggle overlay
Super+z           Toggle scratchpad

Layout
------
Super+n           Switch layout (tile/scroller)
Super+e           Set proportion to 1.0
Super+x           Switch proportion preset

After Installation
------------------
1. Update the system:    sudo pacman -Syu
2. Install yay (AUR):    ~/Scripts/install-yay
3. Initialize keyring:   ~/Scripts/fix-keys
4. Customize desktop:    Edit files in ~/.config/
